# Scratch per-image diagnostic cache written by the interrupted trial under
# `main/`; the accepted run keeps only the CSV summaries.
*.f32

# The repository-wide rule drops every *.npz.  These two records are small and
# are the only way to rebuild the reference-row interventions and the paired
# bootstrap, so they stay under version control.
!**/reference_permutations.npz
!**/ANALYSIS_bootstrap_k*.npz
